# 2. NON-NEGOTIABLE ENGINEERING RULES

The project must follow these rules.

## 2.1 Simulation must be independent of UI

The following must work without loading a visual scene:

```text
create_world()
simulate_day()
simulate_match()
simulate_transfer_window()
advance_player_development()
simulate_season()
simulate_years(100)
```

UI reads simulation state.

UI never defines simulation state.

---

## 2.2 No business logic inside UI scenes

Bad:

```text
TransferScreen.gd
    calculates player value
    determines AI bid
    modifies finances
    updates contract
```

Correct:

```text
TransferScreen
      ↓
TransferService
      ↓
TransferEngine
      ↓
FinanceService
      ↓
Database
```

The UI only issues commands and renders results.

